{"about_the_game":"[Shining Stars]<br><br>The main stage of the game is set in a magical land called Antana, where six countries with diverse customs exist.\u00a0<br>Players will take on the role of a young lord in one of these kingdoms.<br><br>As an evil power is about to invade the land, the player must travel far and wide to find companions, establish a knight order, embark on adventures, enhance strength, and defend the human\u2019s homeland.<br><br>The key features of this DLC update are as follows:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Huge map exploration with tasks and choices.<br></li><li>Over 150 mainline tasks.<br></li><li>Over 240 sub-tasks.<br></li><li>New city-building system<br></li><li>Guild, story, and teammates unlocking systems.</li></ul><br>PS. The English translation for this DLC is not finished yet. We will complete the English soon.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768610?t=1706578458","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768610?t=1706578458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1706578458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1706578458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"[Shining Stars]<br><br>The main stage of the game is set in a magical land called Antana, where six countries with diverse customs exist.\u00a0<br>Players will take on the role of a young lord in one of these kingdoms.<br><br>As an evil power is about to invade the land, the player must travel far and wide to find companions, establish a knight order, embark on adventures, enh